WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:08.607
The two-path decision tarot spread compares two options by
asking what each offers and what each asks of you.

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:10.442
It does not choose for you.

00:00:11.742 --> 00:00:13.037
The six positions.

00:00:13.037 --> 00:00:20.879
The situation, what path A offers, what path A asks of you,
what path B offers, then what path B asks of you.

00:00:22.179 --> 00:00:23.252
How to set it up.

00:00:23.252 --> 00:00:32.152
Before you shuffle, name the two paths in plain words and write them down,
for example "stay in my current role" and "apply for the new job".

00:00:33.552 --> 00:00:35.991
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:35.991 --> 00:00:40.936
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
